检查设备**：确认手环/手表佩戴和同步是否正常\n\n---\n\n需要我帮您制定一个睡眠改善计划，或者设置睡眠提醒吗？","kind":"text","updatedAt":"2026-05-04T00:45:07.826Z"}]},{"thread_id":"b4b29fb9-e43f-4bec-b7ef-4b56d6d9f6d9","role":"user","model_name":"user","client_message_id":"b9769a92-8579-425c-9a60-a9d716c225b1","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-05-04 00:45:15.129000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"deepseek-v4-pro","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","blocks":[{"createdAt":"2026-05-04T00:45:15.129Z","id":"443895E5-48C3-430F-A3B9-795094D3F948","text":"存到知识库","kind":"text","updatedAt":"2026-05-04T00:45:15.129Z"}]}]}
